# build/ holds COPIES of colibri's own source with the patch applied. They are
# generated by the Makefile and must never be committed: this project's whole
# claim is that it does not ship or modify the engine, and a copy of the
# engine sitting in our tree would be exactly that — plus a licence question
# nobody needs.
